msgid "THANKS"
msgstr "THANKS"

#. type: Plain text
#: original/man5/rsyncd.conf.5:1524
msgid ""
"Thanks to Warren Stanley for his original idea and patch for the rsync "
"daemon.  Thanks to Karsten Thygesen for his many suggestions and "
"documentation!"
msgstr "rsync デーモンの独創的なアイデアとパッチを提供してくれた Warren Stanley に感謝します。Karsten Thygesen 氏の多くの提案とドキュメントに感謝します。"

#. type: SH
